        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 49278,
            "text": "Good morning, appreciate you joining on short notice."
          },
          {
            "start": 49279,
            "end": 104030,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for joining, good to see you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 109506,
            "end": 142357,
            "text": "Hi, glad we could find a slot this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 153308,
            "end": 180684,
            "text": "Sounds good, I am ready to take notes as we go."
          },
          {
            "start": 180685,
            "end": 202586,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 213536,
            "end": 240913,
            "text": "Nothing major on our end generally, just a couple of specific items."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 257338,
            "end": 268289,
            "text": "Sounds good, let's get started."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 284715,
            "end": 295665,
            "text": "Staff who move departments still show up with their prior access weeks later because the provisioning sync does not pick up the role change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 306616,
            "end": 328517,
            "text": "One of our regional coordinators moved roles in July and kept her prior permissions for almost six weeks before IT caught it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 344943,
            "end": 383270,
            "text": "Appreciate that, let me confirm one thing before we continue."
          },
          {
            "start": 383271,
            "end": 427072,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 443498,
            "end": 465399,
            "text": "Close to six weeks, until she tried to approve something she should not have had access to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 476350,
            "end": 503726,
            "text": "Thanks for that, let's talk about something else for a minute, how has the rest of the season been?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 514677,
            "end": 536578,
            "text": "Our executive committee meets in between the full board sessions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 542053,
            "end": 574905,
            "text": "Hope the next meeting goes smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 591331,
            "end": 640608,
            "text": "We are still backfilling a role that opened up over the summer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 651559,
            "end": 673460,
            "text": "Congrats to the new hire, glad you found someone."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 678935,
            "end": 695361,
            "text": "Our board added two new members this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 706312,
            "end": 717262,
            "text": "That is good to hear, budgets can be tricky to get through."
